  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 692768768
    m_Localized: Back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792192
    m_Localized: My Album
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792193
    m_Localized: PACK A BASKET TO ADD ITS ITEM
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792194
    m_Localized: <b>{0}</b> / {1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792195
    m_Localized: "{0} / {1} \xB7 collected, +{2}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792196
    m_Localized: "{0} / {1} \xB7 {2} coins when complete"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792197
    m_Localized: '?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792198
    m_Localized: 'New: the Album!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792199
    m_Localized: 'Rosie: "I kept one of everything you sold. {0} items so far! Fill
      a whole department and I''ll pay you {1} coins."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792200
    m_Localized: Open the album
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792201
    m_Localized: Later
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792202
    m_Localized: Rewarded ad
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792203
    m_Localized: A rewarded video plays here in the real game.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792204
    m_Localized: "Playing\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792205
    m_Localized: AD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792206
    m_Localized: COUNTER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792207
    m_Localized: <b>{0}</b> in stock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792208
    m_Localized: all out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792209
    m_Localized: '{0} rows'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792210
    m_Localized: LEVEL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792211
    m_Localized: TRICKY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792212
    m_Localized: Level {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792213
    m_Localized: Tricky Level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792214
    m_Localized: The hammer is in the left column's stock. Dig there first!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792215
    m_Localized: The hammer is in the middle column's stock. Dig there first!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792216
    m_Localized: The hammer is in the right column's stock. Dig there first!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792217
    m_Localized: The hammer is tied up in the left column. Find the key first!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792218
    m_Localized: The hammer is tied up in the middle column. Find the key first!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792219
    m_Localized: The hammer is tied up in the right column. Find the key first!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792220
    m_Localized: Tap the hammer to open the nailed shelf.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792221
    m_Localized: No basket wants this one yet, so it waits on the counter. If the
      counter fills up, you're stuck!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792222
    m_Localized: Basket full! It's on its way, and a new order arrives.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792223
    m_Localized: The labels show how many items are still in the stock behind each
      column.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792224
    m_Localized: 'New: <b>Undo</b>. Took the wrong item? Take it back. Two free per
      level.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792225
    m_Localized: 'A gift from Rosie: <b>two Tidy Ups</b>. Each clears the counter
      when it gets crowded.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792226
    m_Localized: 'A gift from Rosie: <b>two Quick Picks</b>. Each fills a basket
      for you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792227
    m_Localized: The counter is full
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792228
    m_Localized: Only one spot left!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792229
    m_Localized: '{0} complete! +{1} coins'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792230
    m_Localized: Tap the <b>{0}</b>. It goes straight into the basket that asks for
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792231
    m_Localized: Tap <b>+</b> to call one more customer. Free this time!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792232
    m_Localized: Undo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792233
    m_Localized: Quick Pick
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792234
    m_Localized: Tidy Up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792235
    m_Localized: Shuffle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792236
    m_Localized: '{0} +1'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792237
    m_Localized: Quick Pick filled a basket
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792238
    m_Localized: No basket to fill right now
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792239
    m_Localized: Items went back to the stockroom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792240
    m_Localized: The counter is already clear
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792241
    m_Localized: Nothing to shuffle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792242
    m_Localized: Move undone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792243
    m_Localized: Nothing to undo yet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792244
    m_Localized: Out of free undos on this level. Take back your last move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792245
    m_Localized: Fills the basket that's closest to done, pulling items from the
      counter, the shelves, even the stockroom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792246
    m_Localized: Puts up to three items from the counter back on a shelf, so the
      counter has room again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792247
    m_Localized: Mixes up all the items on the open shelves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792248
    m_Localized: Get 2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792249
    m_Localized: Get 1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792250
    m_Localized: Get 1 free
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792251
    m_Localized: Not now
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792252
    m_Localized: Rosie opened a third basket. On the house!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792253
    m_Localized: Extra basket
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792254
    m_Localized: Open a third basket for this level. More baskets, fewer items waiting
      on the counter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792255
    m_Localized: Open
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792256
    m_Localized: Open free
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792257
    m_Localized: Level {0} complete
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792258
    m_Localized: Tricky level complete
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792259
    m_Localized: Beautifully kept!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792260
    m_Localized: Lovely work!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792261
    m_Localized: Shelf cleared!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792262
    m_Localized: The counter never got crowded. That's the neat way to do it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792263
    m_Localized: Keep the counter at {0} items or fewer for three stars.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792264
    m_Localized: Items packed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 822792265
